      "case": "G06-02",
      "status": "PASS",
      "reason": "The browser published, discovered, and edited one satoshi, one piconero, and one raw through two actual Geode relays and a real PWA bridge. Exact atomic strings, event authorship, stable d tags, signatures, and rendered prices survived each round-trip; currency maxima and overflow were checked."
    },
    {
      "case": "G06-03",
      "status": "PASS",
      "reason": "Seller withdrawal hid the offer even after the older signed event was replayed to R2. Geode rejected reinsertion under its deletion tombstone. Another author could not remove an offer; the client reducer ignored an older deletion timestamp without sending that fixture to the relay."
    },
    {
